  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0172",
    "en": "{PAGE}Ugh, screw this! I get all irritated{SAUT}if I don't talk normally sometimes.(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "{PAGE}Pff, laisse tomber! Je m'énerve{SAUT}si je parle pas normalement parfois.(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0173",
    "en": "   ＊yip＊ I'm not in the mood to use the{SAUT}board this time, so I'll just give you{SAUT}my card.(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "＊ouaf＊ Pas d'humeur à utiliser la{SAUT}planche cette fois, alors je te donne{SAUT}juste ma carte.(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0174",
    "en": "   You seem pretty amazing for a human.{SAUT}Let's just talk like normal.(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "T'as l'air plutôt génial pour un humain.{SAUT}Parlons normalement.(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0175",
    "en": "  ＊yip＊ Not only that, I'll give you my{SAUT}card, too. Gracious, aren't I?(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "＊ouaf＊ En plus, je te donne ma carte{SAUT}aussi. Généreux, non?(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0176",
    "en": "   ...L-I-K-E... I-T... A... L-O-T...(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "...A-I-M-E... B-E-A-U-C-O-U-P...(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0177",
    "en": " ...T-H-I-S... I-S... F-O-R... Y-O-U...(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "...P-O-U-R... T-O-I...(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0178",
    "en": " Alright, I'll talk normally... Just stop{SAUT}scaring me so much...(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "Bon, je parle normalement... Arrête{SAUT}juste de me faire si peur...(*OPTION*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "KOKURI.BIN:text:0179",
    "en": " C'mon, I'll give you my card. You won't{SAUT}have any complaints if I do that, right?(*OPTION*)",
    "fr": "Allez, je te donne ma carte. T'auras{SAUT}rien à redire comme ça, hein?(*OPTION*)"
  },
